## 10. Tenant Relations

### 10.1 Communication

1. **Open Channels:** The Property Management Team will establish clear communication channels for tenants to voice concerns or feedback. This may include a dedicated tenant portal, a hotline, or regular community meetings.

2. **Tenant Surveys:** Annual surveys will be conducted to gather tenant feedback on property management services and facilities. Insights gained will guide improvements and enhance tenant satisfaction.

### 10.2 Conflict Resolution

1. **Dispute Resolution Process:** A formal dispute resolution process will be implemented to handle tenant disputes. This process will involve mediation by the Property Manager and, if necessary, escalation to the Management Team.

2. **Tenant Advisory Board:** A Tenant Advisory Board may be established, comprising representatives from various properties. This board will meet quarterly to discuss tenant issues and recommend solutions to management.

### 10.3 Tenant Retention Strategies

1. **Loyalty Programs:** The implementation of a loyalty program offering incentives for long-term tenants, such as discounts on rent for lease renewals, will be considered to encourage tenant retention.

2. **Community Building Events:** Organizing community-building events, such as seasonal celebrations or tenant appreciation days, will foster a sense of community among tenants and enhance overall satisfaction.

